WEBVTT

00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:13,440
What do you recommend for a lymphatic system cleansing?

00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:18,440
Well, you can't technically cleanse your lymphatic system.

00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:22,240
You want to help move your lymph.

00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:23,440
That's what you want to do.

00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:30,720
So let's refer you back to our website and search lymphatic, search lymph, and you'll see

00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:35,560
a bunch of information on how to help move lymph.

00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:40,560
The best way to move lymph is motion, exercise, contraction of muscles.

00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,160
That's the best way to move lymph.

